  {"id": "function:packages/client/ui-settings-general/src/client/DesktopUpdateIndicator.tsx:DesktopUpdateIndicator", "type": "function", "name": "DesktopUpdateIndicator", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-general/src/client/DesktopUpdateIndicator.tsx", "lineRange": [62, 86], "summary": "渲染账户行旁的更新状态按钮：窄侧栏/隐藏/空闲且无配置错误时不渲染；错误点、busy 旋转、下载图标三分态，Tooltip 带完整版本与 prerelease 后缀，busy 时禁止触发打开。", "tags": ["react-component", "status-indicator", "exported"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/ui-settings-general/src/client/DesktopUpdateIndicator.tsx:DesktopUpdateBadge", "type": "function", "name": "DesktopUpdateBadge", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-general/src/client/DesktopUpdateIndicator.tsx", "lineRange": [95, 106], "summary": "折叠侧栏展开钮上的非交互 brand-blue 通知点：断线/连接中（安装相位除外）时让位连接反馈，其余错误/进行中相位保持可见。", "tags": ["react-component", "badge", "exported"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/ui-settings-general/src/client/DeveloperToolsRow.tsx", "type": "file", "name": "DeveloperToolsRow.tsx", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-general/src/client/DeveloperToolsRow.tsx", "summary": "开发者工具可见性开关行：ObservableSnapshot 接受已生效偏好，写入期间禁用输入防重复，失败显示本地化重试指引。", "tags": ["react-component", "settings-row", "switch"], "complexity": "simple"},
