  {"id": "function:packages/client/ui-settings-general/src/client/HostReleasePrompt.tsx:Transition", "type": "function", "name": "Transition", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-general/src/client/HostReleasePrompt.tsx", "lineRange": [43, 52], "summary": "渲染一行带标签的版本过渡：完成态淡化起点，未完成态淡化终点，箭头线随 done 切换实/虚线样式。", "tags": ["react-component", "internal"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/ui-settings-general/src/client/HostReleasePrompt.tsx:HostReleasePrompt", "type": "function", "name": "HostReleasePrompt", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-general/src/client/HostReleasePrompt.tsx", "lineRange": [61, 89], "summary": "渲染 shell.overlay 的 host-release-change 对话框：无变更时返回 null；默认焦点落在\"保持当前版本\"按钮（对话框非用户手势打开，防误触 Enter 重载），重载按钮经 reloadPage 完成页面行过渡。", "tags": ["react-component", "modal-dialog", "exported"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/ui-settings-general/src/client/desktop-channel-source.ts", "type": "file", "name": "desktop-channel-source.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-general/src/client/desktop-channel-source.ts", "summary": "通道观察源：DesktopChannelSource 持有唯一的 shell 通道订阅，合并真实 shell 状态、乐观选择与瞬态 notice 进一个 SnapshotStore，供 General 行与 toast 共享；不读 Host 服务或配置文件。", "tags": ["observable-store", "desktop-update", "data-source"], "complexity": "moderate"},
